! ---- SYSDATA: system data report (General Lens Data, Fields, Vignetting,
! Wavelengths), modelled on Zemax's System Data report.  Paraxial values.
! Infinite conjugates, EPD aperture:
RES osdtriplet
SYSDATA
! PTZ (the optimizer operand): Petzval curvature, 1/(Petzval Radius)
EVA PTZ
! Finite conjugates (4x reduction), object-space NA aperture:
CV2PRG LithoKotaro.seq
NAO 0.1
SYSDATA
! Held image-space F/#:
RES osdtriplet
FNO 4
SYSDATA
